@startuml State_Inbound
title State Machine — Inbound Document (SM-01, Provisional)

' OBJECT  : SMO-01 Inventory Transaction Document — Inbound
' UC      : UC-15 Buat Draft inbound lengkap; UC-16 Post inbound
' FR      : FR-IN-001, FR-IN-002, FR-IN-003, FR-IN-004, FR-IN-005, FR-IN-006, FR-AUD-004, FR-AUD-001
' RULE    : RULE-003, RULE-004, RULE-007, RULE-008, RULE-009, RULE-010, RULE-011, RULE-013, RULE-018, RULE-024, RULE-025, RULE-027
' DECISION: D-B03 Proposed, D-B05 Proposed, D-B06 Proposed, D-B15 Proposed, D-T06 Proposed
' CATATAN : Posting menambah saldo lokasi tujuan. Validated/Cancelled bukan state.

state "Draft" as Draft
state "Posted" as Posted

[*] --> Draft : Create [UC-15, nomor unik RULE-024, master aktif] / simpan header, baris, referensi sumber, saldo tetap

Draft --> Draft : Revise [masih Draft] / simpan ulang baris, saldo tetap

Draft --> Posted : Post [UC-16, permission RULE-011, kuantitas lebih dari nol, serial valid, masih Draft] / transaksi tambah saldo tujuan, movement INBOUND, audit, COMMIT

Draft --> Draft : Post gagal [validasi gagal, tanpa permission, atau error] / ROLLBACK penuh, saldo dan status tetap

Posted --> Posted : Edit/Hapus [RULE-012] / tolak, dokumen utuh

Posted --> [*]

note right of Draft
  RULE-010: Draft tidak mengubah saldo.
  Supervisor opsional, D-B06 Proposed.
end note

note right of Posted
  RULE-013: saldo tujuan bertambah satu kali.
  Immutable; koreksi lewat SM-05.
end note

@enduml
